  - Term: iTunes/Shrek Update
    TermType: 0
    Description:
    Languages:
    - "The Greatest Fairy Tale Never Told comes to Land Sliders to celebrate the 15th anniversary of Shrek!\n\nGet Shrek’d! Explore new levels inspired by locations from the DreamWorks Animation motion picture phenomenon in this ogre-sized adventure! Play for free as Shrek and Big Bad Wolf, and unlock others in two new character packs:\n\nShrek Pack includes:\n\nDonkey\nFiona\nDragon\nLord Farquaad\n\nFairtytale Pack includes:\n\nPuss in Boots\nPinocchio\nGingy\nThree Blind Mice"
